      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آهَلَكَ ٱللّٰهُ فِى الجَنَّةِ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِيهَالٌ</span>, <i>May God
